#: .\chardata\templates\chardata\changelog_content.html:291
msgid "Comments on builds, with comment counts on shared-build cards"
msgstr ""
"Kommentare zu Builds, mit Kommentaranzahl auf den Karten geteilter Builds"

#: .\chardata\templates\chardata\changelog_content.html:292
msgid ""
"User profiles with follow / unfollow, a following feed, and author links on "
