#: .\chardata\templates\chardata\solution.html:161
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you don't like an item, click the forbid ( <img style='position: "
"relative; bottom: -3px; left: -2px;' src=%(delete)s title='Forbid'> ) button "
"under its name and <a href=\"%(run_again_link)s\" class=\"rerun-button\">run "
"again</a>. If, on the contrary, you want to lock in an item for future sets "
"for this char, click the lock (<img style='position: relative; bottom: -1px; "
"left: 0px;' src=%(lock)s title='Lock'>) button. You can also switch any item "
"for another you like best by clicking the switch (<img class='solution-item-"
"button' style='position: relative; bottom: -5px; left: 0px;' src=%(switch)s "
"title='Switch'>) button."
